	// A FOLDER ALREADY A SOFTWARE PROJECT IS REFUSED with `folder_already_a_software_project`. A
	// folder inside another project's folder is its own folder, and may be marked.
	//
	// ONLY A PERSON MARKS A FOLDER. A machine is refused with a 422 on `/body/folder_id`, code
	// `agents_never_mark_a_folder`: there is no person whose share it would be.
