	// EndSoftwareProjectShareWithResponse End a share of a software project
	//
	// THE ACCESS STOPS AT ONCE. The share is ended and never deleted, and ending one that has
	// already ended is not an error.
	//
	// ENDED WHERE IT WAS PLACED, as a share is changed (409 `share_placed_elsewhere`). An id that
	// names no share reaching this project is the 404.
