// ShareSoftwareProjectWithBodyWithResponse Share a software project
//
// ONE OF FOUR ROLES — Viewer, Editor, Manager, Administrator — each the register's
// `software.role.<this word>`. Commenter is not offered on a project, because comments live on
// a build or a screen.
//
// WITH A MEMBER OR A TEAM OF THIS ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT. Nobody by that id here, or no such team,
// is refused (409 `recipient_not_found`), and so is an Onplo person who is not a member here:
// sharing with an outside tester is `shareSoftwareProjectOutward`, which asks Account's
// permission as well (decision 0658).
//
// SHARING AGAIN CHANGES THE SHARE THAT IS THERE. A holder has one grant per object (decision
// 0650), so a person or a team shared with again takes the new role and the new end and keeps
// the id. `created` says which it was and the status is `200` either way.
//
// `access_until` IS THE MOMENT THIS SHARE ENDS, and the time zone it was chosen in (decision
// 0650). Left out, the share has no end. A moment that has already passed is refused (422
// naming `access_until`, `access_until_passed`).
//
// NEVER AN AI AGENT'S TO DO, and never a raw key's: a share is a grant of access (403
// `ring_requires_person`).
//
// THE IDENTITY SERVICE KEEPS THE GRANT, AND WRITES IT ITSELF. When it cannot be reached, 503
// `identity_unavailable`: whether the share landed is not known, so send the same request
// again.
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with POST /software-projects/{software_project_id}/grants (the `ShareSoftwareProject` operationId).
func (c *ClientWithResponses) ShareSoftwareProjectWithBodyWithResponse(ctx context.Context, softwareProjectId SoftwareProjectId, contentType string, body io.Reader, reqEditors ...RequestEditorFn) (*ShareSoftwareProjectResponse, error) {
	rsp, err := c.ShareSoftwareProjectWithBody(ctx, softwareProjectId, contentType, body, reqEditors...)
	if err != nil {
		return nil, err
	}
	return ParseShareSoftwareProjectResponse(rsp)
}

